GitHub Universe 2026
October 28-29, Fort Mason, San Francisco

Early registration is open. In-person passes are $799 through May 31 (regular $1,199); the online pass is free.

The call for talks is also open through April 30. We're looking for sessions on AI-assisted development in production, security at small teams, and open-source maintenance.

Register or submit a talk: https://githubuniverse.com?ref=nl-0324

Also this month: GitHub Copilot's coding agent is now available on all Team plans, and Actions has a new spend dashboard.

GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P Kelly Jr St, San Francisco, CA 94107. Manage email preferences: https://github.com/settings/emails
